Third-party components

- harness/Envoy.java is a Java port of Envoy's adaptive-concurrency GradientController
  (source/extensions/filters/http/adaptive_concurrency/controller/gradient_controller.cc, commit
  b71f63bd875e1df93ea68e04e9fb788dd967a611), Copyright Envoy Project Authors, Apache License 2.0.
  tests/EnvoyPortTest.java re-expresses scenarios of Envoy's gradient_controller_test.cc (Apache License 2.0).
- Netflix concurrency-limits (commit 78a74b9878d38c4c048b0304ce12a162ab7b7222), Apache License 2.0, is fetched and
  compiled unmodified by third_party/fetch_and_build.sh; it is not redistributed here.
- failsafe-go (commit 5759a5e6d557eace215f820f5b5e663d5c05c3ee), MIT License, is fetched by the build script;
  third_party/failsafe_simclock.patch is a three-line change that routes time.Now() through a replaceable clock.
- third_party/slf4j-stub contains a minimal API stub of SLF4J (MIT License) so that the Netflix core compiles offline.
- Azure LLM inference trace 2023: Microsoft, CC-BY 4.0.
